        "---\n",
        "title: \"Is Australia Doing Well? The Widening Blind Spot in 'It's Green Again'\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Why post-fire vegetation greening is an increasingly unreliable proxy for wildlife recovery as heat exposure rises\"\n",
        "author:\n",
        "  - name: \"[Team members + SID]\"\n",
        "    affiliation: \"The University of Sydney - Winter Data Analysis Challenge\"\n",
        "date: today\n",
